WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 bda06700bc7cace998c9ec1d94e9d2aa

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.500
Karibu tena. Mara nyingi katika kupanga programu, tunataka

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:06.940
kutumia kitendakazi na kupata namba nasibu

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:11.400
tofauti kila mara. Hii ni muhimu kwa

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.960
namna na mahali pengi, lakini hasa

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.370
katika kriptografia, ambapo tunafanya mambo mengi

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:19.270
kama kuunda misimbo ya kushirikiana kati ya mashine,

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.660
na misimbo hiyo inahitaji kuwa nasibu

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.980
ili isiweze kudukuliwa. Kukusaidia na hili,

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.160
katika sehemu iliyobaki ya kozi, una

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:33.420
kitendakazi kinachoitwa Math.randomInt. Huenda ukaona

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.920
kuna nukta katikati ya hiyo.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.660
Unapopata vitendakazi zaidi,

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.040
tunaweza kuviweka katika makundi tofauti

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.980
ili kila kitu kiwe chenye mpangilio, na Math

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.720
ni jina la kundi ambamo kitendakazi hiki

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.550
kinapatikana. Inamwambia Jiki aangalie sehemu gani

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.340
ya rafu, ambayo hapa ni

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:54.490
sehemu ya Math. Nukta hiyo inamaanisha tu: nenda

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.440
kwenye sehemu hii na utafute kitendakazi hicho. Usijisumbue

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.920
sana na hili kwa sasa. Maelekezo ya zoezi

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:03.020
yatakuambia kila mara vitendakazi vipi vinapatikana

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:06.740
na jinsi ya kuvitumia. Jambo muhimu

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.940
kuelewa ni hili: Jiki anapotumia

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.380
kitendakazi hiki, kitampa namba tofauti

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.400
kila mara anapokiendesha, lakini kuna

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:19.760
sharti moja. Kitendakazi hiki kina maingizo mawili. La kwanza

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.120
ni namba ndogo zaidi ambayo mashine inaruhusiwa

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:25.220
kuirejesha, na la pili ni namba kubwa zaidi

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:28.160
ambayo mashine inaruhusiwa kuirejesha. Kwa hiyo

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.740
ukitumia kitendakazi cha Math.randomInt pamoja na 10

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:36.820
na 13, utapata kila mara 10, 11, 12,

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.280
au 13 kurudi. Lakini utapata

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:44.120
namba tofauti kila mara. Hebu fikiri

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.200
unataka kuchora duara

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:49.420
mahali nasibu kwenye turubai. Unaweza kutumia

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.500
Math.randomInt kupata thamani tofauti za left

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:56.920
na top kwa nasibu kila mara, lakini ukiweka mipaka,

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.500
tuseme 10 na 90, ili

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.960
zisitoke nje ya turubai. Kila mara

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.020
unapoendesha msimbo huu, duara litachorwa

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:08.460
mahali tofauti kidogo.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.320
Tutaanza na zoezi rahisi la kutengeneza saladi ili

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.680
uzoee wazo la namba nasibu,

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.600
kisha katika mazoezi machache yajayo,

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.120
tutafanya mambo ya kufurahisha sana

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:22.019
nazo. Tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
